{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日流傳一段影片，事發地點位於深水灣香島道。影片顯示在深水灣泳灘對開路段，有一輛的士正往淺水灣泳灘方向行駛。當時一輛城巴停靠在巴士站，一名身穿吊帶裙的女性行人突然棄用附近的交通燈行人過路處，直接從城巴車頭走出橫過馬路，的士司機疑收掣不及將女子撞倒，幸好該名女子傷勢並無大礙，事後更自行站起身子繼續橫過馬路。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-11h20m16s837.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026I2V4W2qe1h1790912247.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-11h20m16s837.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-11h20m24s279.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yugu8kEYVH1790912253.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-11h20m24s279.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-11h20m31s974.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qnn4cYaC4k1790912258.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-11h20m31s974.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">根據香港《道路交通（交通管制）規例》（第374G章）第39條，行人若在距離交通燈過路處、斑馬線、行人天橋或行人隧道 15 米範圍內而不使用該些設施、不遵守交通燈號、或者攀越路邊圍欄及穿過中央分道帶進入車路，均屬違規行為，最高可被判罰款 2,000 元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T03:59:22.099616+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}